extends layouts/layout.pug

block content

    section.page-hero
        .public-container
            span.eyebrow
                | About NDUKA
            h1
                | A structured approach to important personal decisions.
            p
                | NDUKA is a Marriage Intelligence & Verification platform
                | designed to help people obtain and assess relevant
                | information through a discreet, structured and
                | professionally managed investigation process.


    section.intro-section
        .public-container

            .section-heading
                span.eyebrow
                    | What NDUKA Is
                h2
                    | Turning questions into a structured investigation.
                p
                    | Important relationship decisions can involve
                    | questions about identity, personal information,
                    | marital status, residence, employment, education,
                    | litigation, references and online presence.
                    | NDUKA provides a framework for requesting
                    | verification of relevant information rather than
                    | relying solely on informal searches or assumptions.

            .feature-grid

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Structured
                    p
                        | Investigation requests are organised into
                        | defined services, with specific information
                        | collected for the areas selected by the visitor.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Discreet
                    p
                        | Requests involving sensitive personal
                        | information are handled through a controlled
                        | process rather than an open public discussion.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Evidence-focused
                    p
                        | Investigation work is documented so that
                        | relevant findings can be reviewed in a
                        | structured form.


    section.services-preview
        .public-container

            .section-heading
                span.eyebrow
                    | Our Approach
                h2
                    | Information should be investigated and considered
                    | carefully.
                p
                    | NDUKA is designed around a process that separates
                    | the initial request from the operational
                    | investigation work and the final report.

            .feature-grid

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Defined Services
                    p
                        | Visitors choose the investigation areas relevant
                        | to their request. Each service can require
                        | specific particulars needed for the
                        | investigation.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Controlled Workflow
                    p
                        | Accepted requests move through defined
                        | operational stages involving clients, cases
                        | and investigation services.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Structured Reporting
                    p
                        | Findings are managed through the NDUKA report
                        | workflow so that approved reports can be
                        | presented in an organised manner.


    section.intro-section
        .public-container

            .section-heading
                span.eyebrow
                    | How Access Works
                h2
                    | Public submission and client access serve different
                    | purposes.
                p
                    | A visitor can submit an investigation request
                    | without first creating an account. The request is
                    | reviewed through the NDUKA process, while
                    | authenticated client access is used where a client
                    | account is created for the appropriate stage of the
                    | workflow.

            .feature-grid

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Submit Without an Account
                    p
                        | The public request process allows visitors to
                        | provide the information needed for NDUKA to
                        | review their investigation request.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Stay Informed
                    p
                        | A request reference and the contact details
                        | supplied with the request provide channels for
                        | status checking and important communications.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Secure Client Area
                    p
                        | Where a client account is created, authenticated
                        | access provides a separate environment for
                        | viewing information made available to the client.


    section.communication-section
        .public-container

            .section-heading
                span.eyebrow
                    | What NDUKA Is Designed For
                h2
                    | Better information for informed consideration.
                p
                    | NDUKA is intended to support informed decision-making
                    | by providing a structured way to request, investigate
                    | and review relevant information.

            .feature-grid

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Verification
                    p
                        | Obtain relevant information through defined
                        | investigation services and a managed workflow.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Documentation
                    p
                        | Keep the investigation process and its findings
                        | organised so that relevant information can be
                        | reviewed.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Informed Decisions
                    p
                        | NDUKA provides information and investigation
                        | results for consideration. It does not replace
                        | your own judgment about an important personal
                        | decision.


    section.cta-section
        .public-container
            .cta-content
                div
                    span.eyebrow
                        | Explore NDUKA
                    h2
                        | See the investigation services available.
                    p
                        | Review the current services and pricing before
                        | deciding whether to submit an investigation
                        | request.

                div
                    a.btn.btn-primary(
                        href="/services"
                    )
                        | Explore Services

                    a.btn.btn-secondary(
                        href="/start-investigation"
                    )
                        | Start an Investigation
